                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Units with this ability change the minimun range of targeting models without TITANIC or AIRCRAFT due to a weapon&apos;s Unwieldy ability from 36&quot; to 24&quot;.</characteristic>
