                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models with this ability which have a Damage Table must roll 1D3 in each Command phase:
- On a 1,  the model is considered to have half the number of wounds remaining for the purposes of determining what those characteristics are.
- On a 2, add 2&quot; to the Movement characteristics of the model.
- On a 3, add 2&quot; to the Movement characteristics of the model and 2 to the Damage characteristic of Flame and Plasma weapons.</characteristic>
