                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your Command phase. Select one LEGIO TITANICA VEHICLE model from your army. The model regains a Void Shield layer.</characteristic>
