              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="2CP Dread howl" id="78d4-01e2-5be7-c1a5" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in the Movement phase. Select one LEGIO TITANICA VEHICLE model from your army. Roll 2D6, if the result exceeds the Leadership characteristic of a enemy unit within 12&quot; of the model, until the end of the turn, halve the Movement characteristic and substract 2 from the Leadership characteristic of that unit.</characteristic>
