                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your opponent’s Charge phase, when a LEGIO TITANICA VEHICLE unit from your army is selected as a target of a charge, and that unit is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units. Until the end of the phase, Charge movements against that model must consider a Dificult ground penalty.</characteristic>
