                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Warp Charge" typeId="5ffd-b800-c317-532a">8</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">9&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Death Pulse has a warp charge value of 8. If manifested, roll 2D6 for every other unit within 9&quot; of this PSYKER.
- If the result is equal or greater that the Toughness characteristic of the target unit, it suffers D6 mortal wounds.
- If the result doubles the Toughness characteristic of the target unit, it suffers 6 mortal wounds instead.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
