                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Quickening has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, then:
- This PSYKER unit regains D6 Wounds.
- If the result of the Psychic Test was 10+, this PSYKER unit regains an additional 2D6 Wounds.</characteristic>
