                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Death Pulse has a warp charge value of 9. If manifested, select an enemy unit within 24&quot; and visible to this PSYKER unit. Select a model from that unit, and roll as many D6 as the Wounds characteristic of the selected model. For each roll of 4+, the target unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
